# Active Role Selection Example
#
# To select your active role without modifying the tracked .agent/ACTIVE_ROLE file:
# 1. Copy this file or create a file named .agent/ACTIVE_ROLE.local
# 2. Put exactly one of the following lines in that file:
#
# project-lead
# website-developer
# ai-backend-developer
#
# .agent/ACTIVE_ROLE.local is ignored by Git, ensuring local preferences remain private.
